&lt;p&gt;The filmmakers and New College of Florida alum will screen and discuss their chilling film with Professor &lt;strong&gt;Jelani Cobb&lt;/strong&gt;, Dean of Columbia Journalism School, as part of FALL OF FREEDOM, an urgent nationwide call to the arts community to unite in defiance of authoritarian forces sweeping the nation.&lt;/p&gt;
