&lt;p&gt;Hundreds of other FALL OF FREEDOM events will also take place over the weekend around the country because...&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Democracy is under attack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Threats to free expression are rising. Dissent is being criminalized. Institutions and media have been recast as mouthpieces of propaganda. Art matters. Artists are a threat to American fascism.&lt;/p&gt;
